{
    "word": "deflection",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                "word": "deflection",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a28d3ac1-8a3e-4754-a812-ecd75991c91c",
                        "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "deflections"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4856a9a-6e0d-3c06-986a-70cb908ea134",
                        "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of deflecting or something deflected."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53a0184d-a63a-4365-951e-d981b3268854",
                                "sense_id": "f4856a9a-6e0d-3c06-986a-70cb908ea134",
                                "text": "Russell's goalbound shot took a deflection off a defender and went out for a corner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fd02887-796f-4b47-8cb1-652ede1279ac",
                                "sense_id": "f4856a9a-6e0d-3c06-986a-70cb908ea134",
                                "text": "The next morning Oswald stopped short in the middle of his shaving, which in his case involved the most tortuous deflections and grimacings."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "da1675a6-ace0-3564-a534-d29dd179311b",
                        "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Deviation (of a needle or other indicator or mechanism) from a previous position."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4b45c4c-1ceb-44de-89f0-f164caff7ccb",
                                "sense_id": "da1675a6-ace0-3564-a534-d29dd179311b",
                                "text": "At about the time that #1 tyre failed, the Flight Data Recorder shows right rudder deflection. This may have been applied to correct a yaw to the left. (Traces of the left main gear on the runway show that the nose wheels were to the right of the centreline and never crossed it.) About 500 metres from the threshold, the inner wheels of the left main gear bogie had closed from about 2 1⁄2 metres to about one metre to the left of the centreline; this may have been because of over-correction for a tendency to yaw to the left or weather-cocking because of the surface wind. Whatever the reason, the actual deviation would probably have been considered insignificant to the cockpit crew."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a6f1090e-f638-321b-bd68-2b5336995c83",
                        "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of refusing to address something (questions, criticism, etc.)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "figuratively",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddf107b0-d9fc-4284-b50c-b21a166d7cca",
                                "sense_id": "a6f1090e-f638-321b-bd68-2b5336995c83",
                                "text": "“‘I’m focused on the future’ is one of the most generic store-brand fuckboy deflections there is,” Oliver fumed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "16662b24-cc3e-3e38-ab4e-bf57c6342a2c",
                        "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of rejecting culpability by redirecting blame elsewhere."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "25bae337-cc21-338d-90c0-e28673b98065",
                        "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bending or deformation under load."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c480164-2e5b-4fbf-8600-08137921728e",
                                "sense_id": "25bae337-cc21-338d-90c0-e28673b98065",
                                "text": "Tyre design deflection profile under load is about a one-third reduction in tyre section radius. If the tyre is overloaded, over-deflection will occur. Over-deflection results in a larger heat increase than would be expected from under-inflation. If one of a pair of tyres on the same axle is under-inflated, the other tyre may be overloaded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef189e77-048e-476b-a9b4-2e0abdeba692",
                                "sense_id": "25bae337-cc21-338d-90c0-e28673b98065",
                                "text": "The structure was examined and passed by the Board of Trade in February, 1890, after it had been tested with two trains of 50 loaded wagons, each hauled by two engines, and pushed by a third. The trains ran side by side, and their combined weight, including the six engines, was 1,800 tons. The deflections of the girders were precisely in accordance with the calculations of the engineers."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9c90fd8-c835-39dd-b358-d44268005b0c",
                        "entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tactic that forces an opposing piece to leave the square, rank or file it occupies, thus exposing the king or a valuable piece"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc805efc-280f-4709-a7b4-510a421ebea3",
                        "source_entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "source_sense_description": "act of deflecting",
                        "target_lang_word": "déflexion",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "déflexion",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eca3c9c3-ef6f-3676-a4b7-1a2d04ffed2b",
                                        "entry_id": "bf83d2dd-71f8-31a9-b21d-8f0fe58cf9fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mouvement progressif par lequel un corps abandonne la ligne qu’il décrivait pour en suivre une autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0f690b4-8313-4c2a-9fe3-bf736cc22cac",
                                                "sense_id": "eca3c9c3-ef6f-3676-a4b7-1a2d04ffed2b",
                                                "text": "Cependant, si nous reprenons la description du chapite IV, nous pouvons affirmer qu’une collision a pour effet principal de décollimater un faisceau, car elle introduit une déflexion des particules."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c578e455-b093-4884-9735-429452f6d026",
                                                "sense_id": "eca3c9c3-ef6f-3676-a4b7-1a2d04ffed2b",
                                                "text": "Une des prédictions les plus remarquables de cette théorie est la déflexion des rayons lumineux lorsqu’ils croisent des concentrations de matière au cours de leur propagation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "32dde004-a182-4d9b-b011-b3f6236b5928",
                        "source_entry_id": "92a3c2e7-4f92-3c0e-9d99-f565fe34022d",
                        "source_sense_description": "act of deflecting",
                        "target_lang_word": "Ablenkung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Ablenkung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49824825-8271-327d-bf91-a336ea782874",
                                        "entry_id": "90664b92-3460-3619-8a07-87feb55139b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abweichung von einer Richtung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b251706-b107-4699-8f33-547bbb6d4398",
                                                "sense_id": "49824825-8271-327d-bf91-a336ea782874",
                                                "text": "In der Arktis zeigt die Kompassnadel eine Ablenkung vom geographischen zum magnetischen Nordpol."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8008262-a347-3f21-90ac-567b16a5576d",
                                        "entry_id": "90664b92-3460-3619-8a07-87feb55139b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abbringen von einer eingeschlagenen Richtung oder einem eingeschlagenen Ziel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f82e92b5-4c86-465d-95ae-7c6acacf0202",
                                                "sense_id": "e8008262-a347-3f21-90ac-567b16a5576d",
                                                "text": "Die erwünschte Ablenkung der Gegner von ihrer ursprünglichen Marschrichtung ist gelungen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "538589ee-3908-4947-a1b8-695bfd38c96b",
                                                "sense_id": "e8008262-a347-3f21-90ac-567b16a5576d",
                                                "text": "„Dass so demonstrativ und irgendwie anzügliche «um den Penis Herumreden», was viel mit Aufgeblasenheit und anderen pneumatischen Effekten zu tun hat und mit dem nicht geführten Dialog darüber, was die Menschen wirklich gefühlsmäßig belastet (wozu die Beschneidung der Penisvorhaut vermutlich eher nicht gehört), hat eine wichtige Funktion (neben den offensichtlichen, über die man besser schweigen sollte): Die Ablenkung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10ef26db-0825-3592-bc4b-07147f64f05b",
                                        "entry_id": "90664b92-3460-3619-8a07-87feb55139b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "psychische Entspannung/ Zerstreuung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc57200d-42f9-4bd2-b9e8-a523fd8c0d42",
                                                "sense_id": "10ef26db-0825-3592-bc4b-07147f64f05b",
                                                "text": "Nach einem anstrengenden Tag dient Ablenkung der Erholung."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ee6cd4d-92e7-4c5c-b86b-e8490a8a5215",
                                                "sense_id": "10ef26db-0825-3592-bc4b-07147f64f05b",
                                                "text": "„Das sinnlose Herumsitzen und Warten zehrte an den Nerven, die einzige Ablenkung waren das Probetauchen und ritualisierte Handgriffe, die jeden Tag gleich abliefen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf4a100c-f4af-47a5-a954-7b906d84dc05",
                                                "sense_id": "10ef26db-0825-3592-bc4b-07147f64f05b",
                                                "text": "„Trotz aller Selbstreflexionen und Ablenkungen beginnt er, sich vorsichtig und zurückhaltend zu engagieren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33dcef89-e3db-40a2-b98f-8a9a66258d51",
                                                "sense_id": "10ef26db-0825-3592-bc4b-07147f64f05b",
                                                "text": "„In Sachen Geselligkeit und Ablenkung scheiterten die Verhandlungen allerdings.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "663bb423-280b-4c0f-981b-cd1734854449",
                                                "sense_id": "10ef26db-0825-3592-bc4b-07147f64f05b",
                                                "text": "„Ein bisschen Ablenkung konnte er jetzt gut vertragen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
